    "title": "Italian lawmaker denounces citizens involved in Israels genocidal operations in Gaza",
    "text": "Max Civili\nPress TV, Rome\nAn Italian lawmaker has raised a question in parliament, asking the Italian government for explanations over media allegations that hundreds of Italians have joined Israeli forces in the ongoing genocide in Gaza.\nThis as a Lower House session was suspended on Wednesday following an Israeli attack on the Gaza-bound Global Sumud Flotilla in international waters.",
